  "body": "Tucked away in a peaceful Browns Bay cul-de-sac on a generous 675m² freehold site, this well-kept brick home offers the space, comfort and easy lifestyle families are looking for.\r\n\r\nDesigned for practical single-level living, the home features four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master suite with an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. At the heart of the home, the modern kitchen connects seamlessly with the dining and family area, while a separate lounge provides another comfortable space to relax. Both living areas open out to a sunny, private deck, creating effortless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living is a real highlight here. The extensive decking offers plenty of room for entertaining, summer BBQs or simply relaxing with family and friends, with even the perfect spot for a spa pool. With solid brick construction, single-level living and an easy-care outdoor setting, this is a home designed for comfortable, low-maintenance living. A double internal-access garage adds even more everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nThe location completes the package. Browns Bay Beach, cafés, shops and the village are all within easy reach, along with nearby parks and excellent schooling. Zoned for Sherwood School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College, this is a wonderfully convenient place for family living. Come and see what makes this property such an appealing choice. Call me today for viewing times or to arrange a private inspection.",
